#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/pto_toolchain/index.rst:2
msgid "tilelang.contrib.pto_toolchain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/pto_toolchain/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Utilities to invoke the PTO toolchain (ptodsl -> ptoas -> bisheng) for "
"Ascend NPU targets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/pto_toolchain/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"``compile_ptodsl_to_aibin`` lowers one TileLang-generated PTODSL module into "
"an executable CCE ELF (aibin): the PTODSL frontend script "
"(ptodsl_compile.py, run as a subprocess) lowers the source to MLIR, ptoas "
"assembles a fat object, bisheng links it, and the .aicore_binary section of "
"the linked image is extracted as the device binary consumed by the Ascend "
"runtime module."
msgstr ""

