#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/pto_toolchain/index.rst:65
msgid ""
"ptodsl_compile.py runs in a subprocess so the DSL's tracing globals "
"(pto.init_core and friends) never enter this interpreter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/pto_toolchain/index.rst:83
msgid ""
"Parses the ELF64 section table directly instead of shelling out to "
"``readelf``: tokenizing its text output can silently truncate the extract, "
"and a bad extract is only rejected later by ``aclrtBinaryLoadFromData``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/pto_toolchain/index.rst:93
msgid ""
"ptoas compiles the device object with the toolchain it resolves from "
"ASCEND_HOME_PATH, so the CANN identity (which includes the bisheng and the "
"CCE linker inside that install, and the version ptoas gates its ABI on) is "
"recorded."
msgstr ""
